  ],
  "notes": "USB Host pads use the board silkscreen names (5V, D-, D+, GND); the USB HOST inset (GND, USB_HOST_DATA_PLUS GPIO32, USB_HOST_DATA_MINUS GPIO33, USB_HOST_5V_POWER GPIO29) leads to an abstract block, not to the pads, so its names were not merged. HSTX FPC: 14 names (GND, CKN, CKP, D0N, D0P, D1N, D1P, D2N, D2P, D26, D27, SCL, SDA, 3.3V) on leader lines that do not reach individual contacts; not transcribed. MicroSD socket signals, LED, NEOPIXEL, BUTTON skipped."
